### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### idekanin-resolver — API walkthrough
###
### Run these with the IntelliJ HTTP Client (or the VS Code REST Client).
### Hosts come from http-client.env.json — pick the "dev" environment when
### prompted. Start the stack first (from the repository root):
###   docker compose --env-file .env.arangodb -f compose.yaml -p idekanin-resolver up -d
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Gateway liveness
GET {{gateway}}/api/ping

### Worker liveness
GET {{worker}}/api/ping

### ArangoDB version, via the gateway internals endpoint
GET {{gateway}}/api/internals/arangodb

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Full lookup, step 1: initiate (asynchronous request-reply)
### Answers 202 Accepted; the Location header points at the results URL.
### The requestHash is captured for the polling request below.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{gateway}}/api/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "A-24HA001",
  "context": "TAG"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestHash", response.body.requestHash);
    client.log("Poll results at: " + response.headers.valueOf("Location"));
%}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Full lookup, step 2: poll the results URL
### 202 while pending/in_progress (body carries claimedBy once a worker
### picked the request up), 200 when done (results with
### {id, context, relationship}), 500 on error, 504 when timed out.
### Re-run until the status flips to done.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{gateway}}/api/cache/{{requestHash}}

### Validation: blank id answers 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "  ",
  "context": "TAG"
}

### Unknown request hash answers 404
GET {{gateway}}/api/cache/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
